{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Do not let an earlier nonfatal error mask a later JVM fatal.** If an inner hook throws `AssertionError` and a subsequently unwound hook throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, this retains the assertion and discards the fatal. Track fatal failures separately and rethrow them in preference to nonfatal errors; add a nonfatal-first, fatal-later regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77JRAJ","finding_digest":"f34a07c18c86d58528d4a6e51574b8a871ca9ca058043067641ec4a328ffa41a","finding_id":"arf_v1_6nfapqmmq3kykkguu3srk5fyvb","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::later-fatal-precedence","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::later-fatal-precedence","line":115,"observation_digest":"fc758dd3a6e29bb441c79a30acdfcd95c6cc9e432aade0911e67b9809e57d597","observation_id":"aro_v1_7r2y3u5g4kn3iqohtiykzx6nsx","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_6nfapqmmq3kykkguu3srk5fyvb","published_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:56Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ypy2y57vtva3tue6ol67lga5xg","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2cc073779905eb2b61db09fe0e50e867759edd7a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_zfiulu5upppjbwdomxprht5pok","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:56Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
